{{Use dmy dates|date=June 2018}}
The knockout stage was the second and final stage of the [[2006 FIFA World Cup]], following the group stage. The top two teams from each group (16 in total) advance to the knockout stage to compete in a [[Single-elimination tournament|single-elimination]] style tournament. A match was played between the two losing teams of the semi-finals to determine which team finished in third place.<ref>{{cite web |last=Saaid |first=Hamdan |url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/2006full.html |title=World Cup 2006 – Match Details |publisher=[[RSSSF]] |date=7 February 2007 |access-date=30 April 2026}}</ref>

''All times local ([[Central European Summer Time|CEST/UTC+2]])''

